Package: libgcr-4-4
Version: @DEB_GCR_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gcr
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libp11-kit0, libgcrypt20, libgpg-error0
Description: GNOME crypto services library (gcr-4 and gck-2)
 gcr provides certificate/key parsing and the system prompter interfaces used
 by GNOME Shell for keyring prompts; gck wraps PKCS#11 modules. Built without
 the GTK4 viewer widgets and without the ssh-agent.
